<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD IN S.AFRICA V INDIA ONE-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD IN S.AFRICA V INDIA ONE-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN, South Africa 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in</p>
<p>the triangular tournament day-night limited overs match between</p>
<p>South Africa and India at Springbok Park on Thursday:</p>
<p>South Africa:</p>
<p> A.Hudson c Tendulkar b Prasad	    15</p>
<p> G.Kirsten c Singh b Prasad		 73</p>
<p> L.Klusener run out			   15</p>
<p> D.Cullinan c Jadeja b Kumble	     51</p>
<p> J.Rhodes not out			     57</p>
<p> H.Cronje not out			     44</p>
<p> Extras (lb-6 w-7 nb-2)		     15</p>
<p> Total (four wickets - 50 overs)	 270</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-36 2-54 3-165 4-168</p>
<p>Did not bat: S.Pollock, D.Richardson, P.Symcox, C.Matthews,</p>
<p>A.Donald.</p>
<p>Bowling: Srinath 10-0-50-0 (w5), Prasad 10-1-63-2 (nb1),</p>
<p>Ankola 10-0-45-0 (nb1), Kumble 9-0-44-1, Singh 8-0-40-0 (w2),</p>
<p>Jadeja 3-0-22-0</p>
